1
00:03:51,977 --> 00:03:52,728
Sebastien !

2
00:03:53,604 --> 00:03:54,605
Sebastien !

3
00:03:55,022 --> 00:03:55,898
Sebastien !

4
00:03:57,609 --> 00:03:58,610
Sebastien !

5
00:04:35,412 --> 00:04:36,412
Sebastien ?

6
00:04:52,613 --> 00:04:53,613
Sebastien ?

7
00:05:41,428 --> 00:05:42,387
Miss Linh .

8
00:05:42,888 --> 00:05:43,555
Come this way .

9
00:05:48,310 --> 00:05:49,227
Sit down .

10
00:05:53,620 --> 00:05:56,205
I 'm Officer Guy Baron . This is Officer Bao .

11
00:05:57,371 --> 00:05:59,037
Do we need a interpreter ?

12
00:05:59,039 --> 00:06:00,372
I can understand you .

13
00:06:03,159 --> 00:06:08,748
What is your name and your duty at Sa-Cat estate ?

14
00:06:09,707 --> 00:06:11,042
My name is Linh .

15
00:06:12,294 --> 00:06:14,504
I 'm a housemaid at Sa-Cat plantation .

16
00:06:16,006 --> 00:06:17,131
" As you know , . "

17
00:06:17,132 --> 00:06:19,884
Captain Sebastien Laurent was murdered

18
00:06:19,885 --> 00:06:21,678
last night in his bedroom .

19
00:06:22,137 --> 00:06:25,098
We 're questioning all involved .

20
00:06:25,682 --> 00:06:28,686
There 's been a string of murders committed around the area .

21
00:06:29,873 --> 00:06:32,621
We know you discovered the captain 's body

22
00:06:32,623 --> 00:06:35,456
and you 're shaken up . We need your help .

23
00:06:35,458 --> 00:06:37,041
Can you answer some questions ?

24
00:06:39,416 --> 00:06:41,250
How long have you been in Sa-Cat ?

25
00:06:45,704 --> 00:06:46,705
Speak !

26
00:06:49,083 --> 00:06:53,504
I came to Sa-Cat from a small village in the countryside .

27
00:07:06,226 --> 00:07:07,811
I was searching for work .

28
00:07:09,229 --> 00:07:12,733
There weren 't many jobs where I was from .

29
00:07:13,401 --> 00:07:16,404
Much of the countryside was destroyed by the bombings .

30
00:08:11,838 --> 00:08:13,256
What do you want ?

31
00:08:15,008 --> 00:08:18,762
I heard that there 's a need for a housemaid at the estate .

32
00:08:26,979 --> 00:08:28,981
You may call me â € œMrs . Han . "

33
00:08:30,024 --> 00:08:31,067
Mrs. Han .

34
00:08:33,069 --> 00:08:34,362
How do you know of this place ?

35
00:08:35,821 --> 00:08:37,740
From the people at the market .

36
00:08:38,908 --> 00:08:42,496
Then you know of Sa-Cat 's history .

37
00:08:43,121 --> 00:08:45,123
I 'm not from around here .

38
00:08:50,420 --> 00:08:51,129
Thank you .

39
00:08:55,175 --> 00:09:00,139
Have you been a servant at an estate before ?

40
00:09:01,224 --> 00:09:03,017
No . Not yet .

41
00:09:03,851 --> 00:09:08,523
I 've done housework with my mother on the farm .

42
00:09:08,940 --> 00:09:12,736
Sa-Cat is run like a French estate .

43
00:09:13,153 --> 00:09:15,030
Not like a Vietnamese one .

44
00:09:15,739 --> 00:09:16,323
Of course .

45
00:09:17,991 --> 00:09:19,118
Where is your family ?

46
00:09:21,995 --> 00:09:23,163
My family ...

47
00:09:27,710 --> 00:09:30,046
they were all killed during an air raid .

48
00:09:31,548 --> 00:09:33,675
Our farm is gone too .

49
00:09:39,389 --> 00:09:41,725
You have no family members at all ?

50
00:09:44,895 --> 00:09:46,105
No home ?

51
00:09:51,235 --> 00:09:53,362
You walked all the way here from your village ?

52
00:09:54,488 --> 00:09:55,156
Yes .

53
00:09:56,867 --> 00:09:57,701
How far is that ?

54
00:09:58,660 --> 00:09:59,911
About forty kilometers .

55
00:10:06,042 --> 00:10:06,668
Mrs. Han ,

56
00:10:07,377 --> 00:10:08,753
I need a job .

57
00:10:09,754 --> 00:10:10,964
I need a place to live .

58
00:10:11,799 --> 00:10:14,260
This is the only job opening for miles around .

59
00:10:21,517 --> 00:10:22,560
You can stay here .

60
00:10:23,394 --> 00:10:26,482
I 'm only hiring you on a trial basis .

61
00:10:27,191 --> 00:10:30,903
If you work hard , you can stay .

62
00:10:31,153 --> 00:10:32,612
But if you 're a burden

63
00:10:32,613 --> 00:10:34,071
and the food you eat costs more than your worth ,

64
00:10:34,072 --> 00:10:35,448
you will need to find another place .

65
00:10:35,449 --> 00:10:36,449
Is that clear ?

66
00:10:36,450 --> 00:10:37,326
Yes , Ma 'am .

67
00:10:37,951 --> 00:10:39,411
I won 't disappoint you .

68
00:10:42,957 --> 00:10:44,959
You can wear these .

69
00:10:45,752 --> 00:10:47,962
Get yourself acquainted with the manor .

70
00:10:48,421 --> 00:10:49,964
We 'll start tomorrow .

71
00:10:50,965 --> 00:10:52,300
Thank you .

72
00:11:43,397 --> 00:11:45,566
You 're getting blood on the floor .

73
00:11:47,025 --> 00:11:48,235
Sorry .

74
00:11:50,862 --> 00:11:52,531
Here 's some medicine I 've made .

75
00:11:54,700 --> 00:11:55,993
Medicine you 've " made " ?

76
00:11:57,787 --> 00:11:58,955
I practice Eastern medicines and remedies .

77
00:12:00,373 --> 00:12:01,833
Besides being the cook ,

78
00:12:02,417 --> 00:12:03,585
I 'm a herbalist ...

79
00:12:04,627 --> 00:12:05,295
a witch .

80
00:12:06,671 --> 00:12:09,757
Mrs. Han says there are only a few servants in the house .

81
00:12:10,174 --> 00:12:10,675
That 's right .

82
00:12:10,842 --> 00:12:15,514
Just me , Mrs. Han and the groundskeeper , Mr. Chau .

83
00:12:16,098 --> 00:12:18,225
Why doesn 't the Captain hire more servants ?

84
00:12:19,143 --> 00:12:21,812
Most servants won 't work here .

85
00:12:23,397 --> 00:12:24,231
Why not ?

86
00:12:27,527 --> 00:12:28,653
Stupid girl !

87
00:12:30,155 --> 00:12:32,574
You don 't know what you 've gotten yourself into .

88
00:12:34,409 --> 00:12:35,493
I don 't understand .

89
00:12:36,494 --> 00:12:38,455
Sa-Cat is a place of death .

90
00:12:40,665 --> 00:12:43,336
Hundreds of people have died here on the plantation .

91
00:12:44,253 --> 00:12:49,717
The Vietnamese workers used to be violently abused by the French overseers ,

92
00:12:50,009 --> 00:12:52,428
when it was a functioning plantation .

93
00:12:53,220 --> 00:12:56,724
The French recruited from all over the country .

94
00:12:56,725 --> 00:13:01,354
Lied to them about the promise of a good wage and home .

95
00:13:01,355 --> 00:13:04,816
When the poor workers got here ...

96
00:13:06,193 --> 00:13:08,111
What happened to them ?

97
00:13:10,656 --> 00:13:12,742
Workers were whipped to death .

98
00:13:14,410 --> 00:13:15,995
Women were violated .

99
00:13:18,623 --> 00:13:20,958
Children were torn from their families .

100
00:13:22,669 --> 00:13:28,425
Hundreds of bodies lay buried beneath those rubber trees without gravestones .

101
00:13:29,218 --> 00:13:33,471
Many claim that the plantation was fertilized

102
00:13:33,472 --> 00:13:36,809
by the bodies of these workers .

103
00:13:40,562 --> 00:13:45,693
There are many spirits ...

104
00:13:45,694 --> 00:13:48,530
roaming those woods .

105
00:13:50,782 --> 00:13:51,741
Spirits ?

106
00:13:53,493 --> 00:13:55,578
I thought I heard something earlier .

107
00:13:56,997 --> 00:13:59,542
You heard the crying , right ?

108
00:14:01,502 --> 00:14:02,795
Who is it ?

109
00:14:03,295 --> 00:14:07,383
Captain Laurent once had a wife , Madame Camille ,

110
00:14:07,717 --> 00:14:11,053
and a child who lived at this estate .

111
00:14:11,972 --> 00:14:14,891
While he was away at war ,

112
00:14:15,809 --> 00:14:21,732
Madame Camille went mad with loneliness waiting for the Captain to return .

113
00:14:24,067 --> 00:14:28,072
She never liked Vietnam , which made her insane .

114
00:14:29,782 --> 00:14:30,950
Until one day ,

115
00:14:34,245 --> 00:14:35,872
as she was bathing the baby ,

116
00:14:39,917 --> 00:14:42,337
she drowned him in the tub .

117
00:14:46,508 --> 00:14:52,221
Madame Camille kept the dead baby

118
00:14:52,222 --> 00:14:54,725
until it rotted and decayed .

119
00:15:06,488 --> 00:15:10,867
Realizing what she had done and consumed with grief ,

120
00:15:15,164 --> 00:15:19,543
she took their dead son to the lake ...

121
00:15:21,378 --> 00:15:22,880
and drowned herself .

122
00:15:33,725 --> 00:15:35,393
You are afraid of ghosts , aren 't you ?

123
00:15:38,688 --> 00:15:41,191
My mother said there is no such thing as ghosts .

124
00:15:42,276 --> 00:15:43,528
Oh , they exist .

125
00:15:46,739 --> 00:15:48,407
Ghosts exist .

126
00:15:55,498 --> 00:15:59,086
You start with the windows .

127
00:16:00,420 --> 00:16:04,091
Never look at the Captain or his guests in the eyes .

128
00:16:05,717 --> 00:16:08,637
You must show your obedience and servitude .

129
00:16:12,058 --> 00:16:14,309
Always get the freshest produce .

130
00:16:14,310 --> 00:16:16,479
Even a day old isn 't good enough .

131
00:16:21,526 --> 00:16:22,569
And most importantly ...

132
00:16:24,404 --> 00:16:28,199
it 's forbidden to speak of Lady Camille and Captain Laurent 's child .

133
00:16:28,200 --> 00:16:28,784
Understood ?

134
00:16:29,285 --> 00:16:29,869
I understand .

135
00:16:32,204 --> 00:16:32,955
Mr. Chau .

136
00:16:37,376 --> 00:16:38,168
This is Linh .

137
00:16:38,752 --> 00:16:41,547
She will be working for us as a housemaid if things work out .

138
00:16:43,383 --> 00:16:44,050
How do you do ?

139
00:16:45,886 --> 00:16:46,970
Nice to meet you .

140
00:16:48,972 --> 00:16:51,182
If you run out of wood , Mr. Chau can help you .

141
00:16:52,183 --> 00:16:53,434
On the colder evenings ,

142
00:16:53,435 --> 00:16:57,607
Captain Laurent likes fireplaces because they remind him of his childhood .

143
00:17:00,526 --> 00:17:03,654
Thank you but I think I can manage it .

144
00:17:04,697 --> 00:17:06,699
Mr. Chau doesn 't live in the manor

145
00:17:07,658 --> 00:17:09,243
but in the shacks close to the plantation trees .

146
00:17:43,864 --> 00:17:46,200
Is Mrs. Han working you too hard ?

147
00:17:46,533 --> 00:17:47,576
Not at all .

148
00:17:51,580 --> 00:17:52,665
What 's happening ?

149
00:17:54,875 --> 00:17:56,585
It happens occasionally .

150
00:17:57,337 --> 00:17:59,005
Power should be back up in the morning .

151
00:18:00,048 --> 00:18:02,384
We are in a war , after all .

152
00:18:09,057 --> 00:18:09,975
Are you afraid ?

153
00:18:15,106 --> 00:18:15,815
No , Ma 'am .

154
00:18:17,858 --> 00:18:19,110
Good night .

155
00:21:07,122 --> 00:21:07,873
What happened ?

156
00:21:08,748 --> 00:21:10,792
Captain Laurent !

157
00:21:12,587 --> 00:21:13,754
What ? Captain Laurent !

158
00:21:14,172 --> 00:21:14,839
Captain Laurent !

159
00:21:15,047 --> 00:21:17,341
He 's been shot !

160
00:21:18,718 --> 00:21:20,386
Bring him inside immediately .

161
00:21:20,678 --> 00:21:21,179
Quickly !

162
00:21:23,848 --> 00:21:25,057
Watch your step , Sir .

163
00:21:37,487 --> 00:21:39,030
Sebastien , Fighting !

164
00:21:39,031 --> 00:21:41,200
Mrs Han , Hold him steady .

165
00:21:41,491 --> 00:21:42,784
I almost have the bullet .

166
00:21:42,785 --> 00:21:44,494
We need more morphine .

167
00:21:44,495 --> 00:21:46,289
I will take the bullet out .

168
00:21:50,977 --> 00:21:51,975
Sebastien !

169
00:21:57,551 --> 00:21:58,344
Sebastien !

170
00:21:58,969 --> 00:21:59,762
Sebastien !

171
00:22:00,638 --> 00:22:01,180
Please ...

172
00:22:02,139 --> 00:22:04,099
We need to give him Eastern medicine .

173
00:22:04,516 --> 00:22:06,435
He won 't survive without it .

174
00:22:07,019 --> 00:22:10,147
You know that his family forbids it .

175
00:22:10,648 --> 00:22:13,193
Western doctors know nothing of these matters of survival .

176
00:22:13,818 --> 00:22:15,362
This is not your decision to make .

177
00:22:15,946 --> 00:22:17,197
I am the housekeeper .

178
00:22:17,697 --> 00:22:19,574
He 'll die before morning !

179
00:22:20,033 --> 00:22:20,700
Stop .

180
00:22:21,159 --> 00:22:23,245
I forbid you to go in there .

181
00:22:23,536 --> 00:22:27,166
I forbid you from leaving the servants quarters

182
00:22:27,959 --> 00:22:30,503
until he is well again .

183
00:22:31,128 --> 00:22:32,463
If he dies ,

184
00:22:33,464 --> 00:22:36,175
you will have Madame Camille to answer to .

185
00:22:46,395 --> 00:22:48,397
Are you making breakfast ?

186
00:22:50,774 --> 00:22:52,401
Take Captain Laurent 's breakfast up to his room .

187
00:22:53,443 --> 00:22:54,236
By myself ?

188
00:22:56,947 --> 00:22:58,074
Stupid girl .

189
00:22:58,366 --> 00:23:00,201
I 've been banished from his living quarters .

190
00:23:00,576 --> 00:23:01,494
You 'll have to do it .

191
00:23:01,744 --> 00:23:02,537
Hurry !

192
00:23:57,193 --> 00:23:59,526
Who are you ? Why are you here ?

193
00:23:59,528 --> 00:24:01,651
Get out of my home ! Get out !

194
00:24:01,653 --> 00:24:02,776
I 'm sorry .

195
00:24:11,610 --> 00:24:13,529
There 's been an emergency in my family .

196
00:24:14,489 --> 00:24:16,908
I 'll need to leave Sa-Cat for a few weeks .

197
00:24:18,409 --> 00:24:19,911
My mother is gravely ill

198
00:24:22,080 --> 00:24:26,500
and I need to travel to Saigon to visit her before she ...

199
00:24:26,501 --> 00:24:28,128
How long will you be gone ?

200
00:24:28,837 --> 00:24:29,963
I don 't know .

201
00:24:30,672 --> 00:24:31,715
Linh .

202
00:24:32,591 --> 00:24:33,175
Yes , Ma 'am .

203
00:24:33,176 --> 00:24:38,555
You will be in charge of taking care of Captain Laurent .

204
00:24:41,517 --> 00:24:42,227
Mrs. Han ,

205
00:24:43,228 --> 00:24:45,230
she doesn 't have the experience to do that .

206
00:24:46,689 --> 00:24:49,067
I don 't know if I could do this alone .

207
00:24:50,026 --> 00:24:51,069
It 's an order .

208
00:25:59,017 --> 00:26:00,727
Work faster !

209
00:26:02,604 --> 00:26:03,771
No talking !

210
00:26:05,440 --> 00:26:06,065
Do you hear me ?

211
00:26:13,324 --> 00:26:14,867
Remember not to put the tree bark down .

212
00:26:15,534 --> 00:26:16,160
You two !

213
00:26:22,458 --> 00:26:23,666
Sir ! Sir !

214
00:26:23,667 --> 00:26:25,628
She didn 't know !

215
00:26:26,295 --> 00:26:27,589
It 's my first time , sir !

216
00:26:28,048 --> 00:26:28,673
Please , sir !

217
00:26:28,798 --> 00:26:29,299
You two .

218
00:26:30,342 --> 00:26:31,801
You know how much that sap is worth ?

219
00:26:33,178 --> 00:26:34,638
More than both of you combined !

220
00:26:34,971 --> 00:26:35,805
Sir , please forgive her .

221
00:26:37,057 --> 00:26:37,682
Sir ! Please , sir !

222
00:26:42,229 --> 00:26:43,064
Hold her down !

223
00:26:45,775 --> 00:26:47,026
It 's my first time ! I didn 't know !

224
00:26:47,276 --> 00:26:47,902
Put your hand out !

225
00:27:11,218 --> 00:27:11,843
Back to work !

226
00:28:25,964 --> 00:28:27,132
Linh , wake up !

227
00:28:27,675 --> 00:28:29,260
The Captain 's gotten worse .

228
00:28:30,720 --> 00:28:31,763
What 's happened ?

229
00:28:32,805 --> 00:28:34,474
He has an infection and a high fever .

230
00:28:34,724 --> 00:28:35,974
He 'll need a doctor .

231
00:28:35,975 --> 00:28:37,185
Who are you going to get at this hour ?

232
00:28:38,227 --> 00:28:38,936
What are you doing ?

233
00:28:42,524 --> 00:28:43,651
Mrs. Han forbids it .

234
00:28:44,068 --> 00:28:46,361
But what if he dies while on your watch ?

235
00:28:46,362 --> 00:28:47,696
The Western medicine hasn 't worked .

236
00:28:48,197 --> 00:28:49,740
I made a promise to Mrs. Han .

237
00:28:50,199 --> 00:28:51,825
He could die any second now !

238
00:28:52,576 --> 00:28:54,077
Do you want to be responsible for his death ?

239
00:28:54,078 --> 00:28:54,953
Don 't stop me .

240
00:28:55,579 --> 00:28:58,208
Captain , drink some of this .

241
00:29:07,676 --> 00:29:08,802
What do we do now ?

242
00:30:00,023 --> 00:30:01,442
It 's not working .

243
00:30:47,220 --> 00:30:48,805
Were you here last night ?

244
00:30:49,555 --> 00:30:50,845
Yes , captain .

245
00:30:54,345 --> 00:30:56,930
I just saw flashes of what happened .

246
00:30:58,931 --> 00:31:01,804
Thought I saw your face .

247
00:31:01,806 --> 00:31:09,844
Mrs. Ngo is the one you should thank .

248
00:31:09,846 --> 00:31:13,513
You speak well .

249
00:31:13,515 --> 00:31:14,640
Not really .

250
00:31:18,932 --> 00:31:20,057
How did you learn ?

251
00:31:22,015 --> 00:31:25,723
My aunt was a school teacher .

252
00:31:27,057 --> 00:31:28,848
She taught me and my brother .

253
00:31:37,098 --> 00:31:38,596
It 's nice to have someone else in the house

254
00:31:38,598 --> 00:31:39,973
who understands me .

255
00:31:56,099 --> 00:31:58,185
We need to clean your wound ..

256
00:31:59,225 --> 00:32:01,350
... from the infection .

257
00:32:05,725 --> 00:32:07,017
I need to bathe you .

258
00:32:57,438 --> 00:32:59,064
How long have you been here ?

259
00:33:00,604 --> 00:33:02,979
Just a couple of weeks , captain .

260
00:33:06,479 --> 00:33:08,064
Do you like it so far ?

261
00:33:10,022 --> 00:33:15,271
Yes , captain .

262
00:33:15,273 --> 00:33:16,981
Pass me my scotch .

263
00:33:40,524 --> 00:33:41,899
I 'm sorry .

264
00:33:48,607 --> 00:33:51,648
Those damn revolutionaries .

265
00:33:51,650 --> 00:33:54,233
Got me in an ambush on my way home .

266
00:33:57,650 --> 00:33:59,856
I 'm glad you survived it .

267
00:35:32,211 --> 00:35:34,463
You saw her , didn 't you ?

268
00:35:36,048 --> 00:35:37,007
Who ?

269
00:35:38,425 --> 00:35:40,552
Madame Camille .

270
00:35:47,519 --> 00:35:50,313
Will you show her to me ?

271
00:35:50,855 --> 00:35:52,524
I can 't show you .

272
00:35:53,108 --> 00:35:54,442
The Captain forbids it .

273
00:36:03,202 --> 00:36:05,955
It 's been many years since anyone 's been in this room .

274
00:36:11,418 --> 00:36:12,921
What did you see ?

275
00:36:14,381 --> 00:36:16,591
A woman in a black dress .

276
00:36:23,473 --> 00:36:27,561
Madame Camille . She never smiled .

277
00:36:28,896 --> 00:36:31,190
These are the very last photos of her .

278
00:36:38,948 --> 00:36:41,617
Captain Laurent ?

279
